      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِنَّهُ فِى حِيرَ بِيرَ</span></b>  and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حِيرٍ بِيرٍ</span>, like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُورٍ بُورٍ</span>; (K;)
